---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us - Manna Kitchen | Our Story"
  description="Learn about Manna Kitchen's heartwarming story. Two sisters from Theresapark, Pretoria creating homemade food with love and dedication. Fresh ingredients, traditional recipes, family business.">

  <article class="about-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Our Story</h1>
    </section>

    <section class="story">
      <h2>From Hardship to Hope</h2>
      <p>
        Manna Kitchen was born from both love and necessity. Two sisters, bound by family and
        faith, found themselves facing an unexpected challenge when one was diagnosed with
        Guillain-Barre syndrome -- a rare neurological condition that required extensive medical
        treatment and ongoing care.
      </p>
      <p>
        What started as a way to generate revenue for medical expenses has blossomed into
        something far greater. From their home kitchen in Theresapark, Pretoria, these sisters began
        creating the wholesome, homemade foods they grew up with -- dishes made with love,
        patience, and the finest ingredients they could find.
      </p>
      <p>
        Word spread quickly among neighbors and friends. People didn't just come back for the
        food; they came back for the care woven into every dish, the personal touch in every
        interaction, and the knowledge that their purchase was helping a family in need.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, Manna Kitchen is a thriving family business, but we haven't forgotten our roots.
        Every platter we prepare, every meal we pack, carries that same dedication and personal
        attention that started it all.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="what-makes-us-special">
      <h2>What Makes Manna Special</h2>
      <div class="special-points">
        <div class="point">
          <h3>Made with Love</h3>
          <p>
            Every item is prepared by hand, with the same care we'd give to feeding our own
            family. No shortcuts, no compromises.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="point">
          <h3>Fresh & Pure</h3>
          <p>
            We use only fresh ingredients with no preservatives or artificial additives. What
            you taste is real food, made the old-fashioned way.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="point">
          <h3>Supporting Family</h3>
          <p>
            When you order from Manna Kitchen, you're not just getting great food -- you're
            supporting a family business with a heartfelt story.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how-it-works">
      <h2>How Ordering Works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <strong>Browse our menu</strong> of products and ready-made meals
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Build your custom platter</strong> or select a weekly meal
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Order via WhatsApp</strong> for personal service and quick response
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Pick up fresh and ready</strong> at our Theresapark location
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="cta">
        We love chatting with our customers! Reach out anytime on WhatsApp.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #8b5a3c;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #6b4423;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: #8b5a3c;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #6b4423;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4a3728;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .special-points {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .point {
    background: #fdf8f3;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #d4a574;
  }

  .point p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .steps {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4a3728;
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .steps li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .steps strong {
    color: #8b5a3c;
  }

  .cta {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #8b5a3c;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* Mobile-first responsive design */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-page {
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    p,
    .steps {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .point {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 641px) {
    .special-points {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
